{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04752","headline":"奉和御制与宋璟源乾曜同日上官命宴东堂赐诗应制 · 张说","name":"奉和御制与宋璟源乾曜同日上官命宴东堂赐诗应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大块熔羣品，经生偶圣时。\n猥承三事命，虚忝百僚师。\n右揆谋华硕，前星傅重资。\n连骞求旧礼，滥典乐贤诗。\n赐釜同荣拜，摐金宴宰司。\n菊花吹御酒，兰叶捧天词。\n宝历休明盛，颓年晷漏衰。\n少留青史笔，未敢赤松期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04752.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04752","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}